WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
- So speaking of "The
Mummy", is it true that,

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.410
is this the one that you almost died?

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.630
- Nearly, well, I was
choked out accidentally.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:07.710
There's a hanging sequence.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.510
- I know what you're
talking about, the sequence.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.760
I didn't know that that actually happened.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.234
- Well, I don't remember
too, oh gosh, yeah.

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:16.050
- They tightened it so much that you,

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.360
like they had, like what happened?

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.540
- I was standing on my toes
like this with the rope

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.060
and you know, you only got so far to go.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.110
And Steve ran over and he said,

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:28.320
hey, it doesn't really
look like you're choking.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.153
Can you

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.133
sell it?

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.760
And I'm like, all right, fine.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.410
So I thought, one more take man.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.470
And the camera swooped around
and I went up on the toes,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.590
and the guy holding the rope above me,

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.450
he pulled it up a little higher
and I was stuck on my toes.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.460
I had nowhere to go but down.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.080
And so he was pulling
up and I was going down.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.350
And then the next thing I
knew, my elbow was in my ear.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.990
The world was sideways and
there was gravel in my teeth.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:56.250
And everyone was really quiet
and there was a stunt guy,

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.230
the coordinator was there
and he was going (claps)

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.063
Brendan,

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.680
Brendan, wake up.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.757
And I'm like, oh, what,
what happened, what is this.

00:01:03.757 --> 00:01:05.730
"Congratulations. You're in the club.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:08.873
Same thing happened to
Mel Gibson on Braveheart."

00:01:08.873 --> 00:01:10.470
- Oh my God.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.433
- Thanks, I think.

00:01:12.402 --> 00:01:14.400
I wanna go home.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.320
- I love that he said
Mel Gibson in Braveheart.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.790
Was he like accidentally gutted?

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:20.370
- I think he--
- Like, what was that?

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.650
- We're off to a blazing
start in this movie so far.

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:24.450
- Oh my gosh, that's scary.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.000
I would've been like, the acting is fine.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.200
I'm not choking for you.

